<section class="sg-sec" id="inspired"><h2>What it inspired</h2><ul class="sg-chain"><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Anand Math (film)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1952</span><span class="sg-chain-h">refrain set to the Govinda Damodar Stotram of Bilvamangala Thakura</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Purab Aur Paschim (film)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1970</span><span class="sg-chain-h">sung in the film</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Freddy Got Fingered (film)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">2001</span><span class="sg-chain-h">chanted in a scene</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Om Jai Jagadish (film)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">2002</span><span class="sg-chain-h">inspired the film and its title</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Baghban (film)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">2003</span><span class="sg-chain-h">sung as an arti by Udit Narayan and Sneha Pant</span></li></ul></section>
